## Validação de Integração com Docker (Próximo Passo Manual)

```bash
# 1. Subir o banco de dados
docker-compose up -d

# 2. Subir o servidor
cd backend && npm run dev

# 3. Testar cadastro
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/iam/register \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"email":"teste@celilac.com","password":"Senha@123","role":"CELIACO"}'
# Esperado: 201 { "id": "...", "email": "teste@celilac.com", "role": "CELIACO" }

# 4. Testar login
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/iam/login \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"email":"teste@celilac.com","password":"Senha@123"}'
# Esperado: 200 { "token": "eyJ...", "expiresIn": "7d" }

# 5. Health check
curl http://localhost:3000/health
# Esperado: { "status": "OK", "service": "CeLiLac Backend" }
```

